[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6562671139","html_url":"https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/15201#issuecomment-6562671139","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/15201","id":6562671139,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC1mGT88AAAABhypqIw","user":{"login":"freddymaciel","id":346108661,"node_id":"U_kgDOFKEy9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/346108661?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/freddymaciel","html_url":"https://github.com/freddymaciel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freddymaciel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freddymaciel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freddymaciel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freddymaciel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freddymaciel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freddymaciel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freddymaciel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freddymaciel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freddymaciel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-01T19:19:40Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T19:19:40Z","body":"We observed the same `windows-2022` image identity mismatch on a separate GitHub-hosted run (November 1, 2026, runner 2.338.2).\n\n`Set up job` reported `20261025.346.1`, while the process `ImageVersion` reported `20261026.347.1`.\n\nThis was a metadata-only observation; no compiler or application was executed.\n\nCould the team clarify which image revision was actually provisioned, why these identity sources disagree, and which release or verification method will establish that the discrepancy has been resolved?\n\nWe are preserving both observed values and cannot approve the image identity until they are reconciled."